  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass10496C79AEE64D72A513B5B8C7EE2BC1\"><p>AKU-ISMC's Professor Jonas Otterbeck made the <a href=\"http&#58;//www.kabar.kg/eng/news/professor-from-london-about-his-visit-to-kyrgyzstan/\" target=\"_blank\">news </a>during a recent visit to&#160;Kyrgyzstan. Professor Otterbeck attended a conference in Bichkek where he shared his research on Muslim Youth in Sweden. In a wide-ranging interview he spoke about the importance of pluralism and his work at ISMC and his life-long interest in Islam.</p></div>",
